  "id": "welsh-beef-and-vegetable-broth",
  "name": "Welsh Beef and Vegetable Broth",
  "subtitle": "A hearty broth with tender beef, root vegetables, cabbage, and leeks.",
  "description": "Beef shank and vegetables simmer together for a substantial soup finished with fresh parsley.",
